# Numeric id of the folder the solution deployed into. Needed for `npm run dev`
# only — deployed, the app reads the folder from an injected meta tag.
#
# `uip or folders list` shows the folder KEY (a GUID), not the numeric id. Read
# the id from
#   GET {baseUrl}/{org}/{tenant}/orchestrator_/odata/Folders
# and take the `Id` field of the folder named CallingModeSample.
VITE_UIPATH_FOLDER_ID=
